COMMAND: add_clock_gates_obs
==================================================
  add_clock_gates_obs: inserts and connects observability logic 

Usage: add_clock_gates_obs [-hierarchical] [-make_obs_module] [-disable_clock] [-libcell <string>] [-max_cg <integer>] [-ignore_clock_constraint] [-exclude <inst|hinst>+]

    [-hierarchical]:
        insert observability logic across hierarchies (default false) 
