COMMAND: add_hard_repair
==================================================
  add_hard_repair: inserts hard repair interface for memories 

Usage: add_hard_repair [-allow_unused_instructions] -config_file <string> [-direct_access_only] [-connect_to_jtag] [-dont_create_hri_ports] [-dont_scan]
           [-dft_cfg_mode <dft_configuration_mode>] [-alt_dft_cfg_mode <dft_configuration_mode>] [-schedule_instruction <string>] [-check_instruction <string>]
           [-test_plan_instruction <string>] [-repair_instruction <string>] [-constraint_instruction <string>] [-directory <string>] [<design>]

    [-allow_unused_instructions]:
        allow unused instruction decodes beyond those required for this design 
    -config_file <string>:
        name of the design specific configuration file 
    [-direct_access_only]:
        insert without JTAG Macro 
    [-connect_to_jtag]:
        make connections from the fuse control logic to the JTAG_Macro pins 
    [-dont_create_hri_ports]:
        do not create hard repair interface ports at the top-level design 
    [-dont_scan]:
        allows a hard repair insertion flow without test signals when the hard repair flops are not scan replaced 
    [-dft_cfg_mode <dft_configuration_mode>]:
        configuration mode in which netlist back-tracing is to be done under JTAG or all modes of operations (default: pmbist_hr) 
    [-alt_dft_cfg_mode <dft_configuration_mode>]:
        configuration mode in which netlist back-tracing is to be done for non-JTAG mode of operation (default: pmbist_hr) 
    [-schedule_instruction <string>]:
        name of the jtag instruction to select active repair channels (default: 'FCUSCH') 
    [-check_instruction <string>]:
        name of the jtag instruction to report operational status (default: 'FCUCHK') 
    [-test_plan_instruction <string>]:
        name of the jtag instruction to schedule testplans (default: 'FCUTPN') 
    [-repair_instruction <string>]:
        name of the jtag instruction for fuse controller to repair register mapping (default: 'FCURR') 
    [-constraint_instruction <string>]:
        name of the jtag instruction for algorithm memory and test constraints (default: 'FCUAMR'), required only with programmable testplans 
    [-directory <string>]:
        work directory (default: './hri_<design name>') 
    [<design>]:
        name of the top-level design 

