COMMAND: add_jtag_boundary_scan
==================================================
  add_jtag_boundary_scan: inserts boundary scan cells and the corresponding JTAG_Macro controller 

Usage: add_jtag_boundary_scan [-comp_enables_high <port>+] [-comp_enables_low <port>+] [-design <design>] [-dont_map] [-exclude_ports <port>+] [-functional_clocks <port>+]
           [-custom_cell_directory <string>] [-pinmap_file <string>] [-preserve_tdo_connection] [-preview] [-jtag_macro_location <inst|hinst>] [-boundary_cell_location <inst|hinst|design>]
           [-tck <port>] [-tdi <port>] [-tdo <port>] [-tms <port>] [-trst <port>] [-power_on_reset <pin|hpin|port>] [-generate_wrck] [-physical] [-skip_checking_tap_port_iocell]
           [-no_trst_test_signal]

    [-comp_enables_high <port>+]:
        dedicated test ports that will be held to an active-high value during the system operation of the chip 
    [-comp_enables_low <port>+]:
        dedicated test ports that will be held to an active-low value during the system operation of the chip 
    [-design <design>]:
        the name of the top-block (required if there are multiple top designs) 
    [-dont_map]:
        do not map the boundary scan logic to technology gates 
    [-exclude_ports <port>+]:
        excludes boundary cells from being inserted at these ports 
    [-functional_clocks <port>+]:
        ports seen as clocks for ATPG (includes async set/reset and clocks not used for scan shift) 
    [-custom_cell_directory <string>]:
        directory which contains the Verilog RTL files for the custom boundary cells 
    [-pinmap_file <string>]:
        file containing a mapping between logical ports and actual package pins (also used to determine the boundary scan order) 
    [-preserve_tdo_connection]:
        preserve existing from-core PAD pin connection for JTAG TDO port 
    [-preview]:
        do not modify the netlist 
    [-jtag_macro_location <inst|hinst>]:
        instance inside which the JTAG_Macro should be instantiated 
    [-boundary_cell_location <inst|hinst|design>]:
        instance inside which the boundary cells should be instantiated 
    [-tck <port>]:
        JTAG TCK port name (default: TCK) 
    [-tdi <port>]:
        JTAG TDI port name (default: TDI) 
    [-tdo <port>]:
        JTAG TDO port name (default: TDO) 
    [-tms <port>]:
        JTAG TMS port name (default: TMS) 
    [-trst <port>]:
        JTAG TRST port name (default: TRST) 
    [-power_on_reset <pin|hpin|port>]:
        power-on-reset pin name 
    [-generate_wrck]:
        generate 1500 WRCK 
    [-physical]:
        configure boundary scan chain to minimize the wirelength 
    [-skip_checking_tap_port_iocell]:
        skip checking pad cell on TAP ports for block level insertion 
    [-no_trst_test_signal]:
        no test signal is defined on the trst port 

