COMMAND: add_test_point
==================================================
  add_test_point: inserts a test point 

Usage: add_test_point -location <pin|hpin|port>+ [-test_control <test_signal>] [-test_clock_pin <pin|hpin|port>] [-rise] [-fall] [-node <pin|hpin|port>]
           [-gate_clock_test_control <test_signal>] [-gate_clock_for_observe <test_signal>] [-type <string>] [-max_observe_share <integer>] [-dont_map]

    -location <pin|hpin|port>+:
