        bypass_scan sync_0 sync_1 sync_any double_control_0 double_control_1 double_control_observe_0 double_control_observe_1} 
    [-max_observe_share <integer>]:
        maximum number of locations to be shared for an observe test point 
    [-dont_map]:
        do not techmap the testpoint even though design is mapped 

