Usage: create_snapshot [-name <string>] [-auto {default|min}] [-categories <string>] [-exclude_time_metric] [-push] [-pop] [<string>]

    [-name <string>]:
        snapshot name 
    [-auto {default|min}]:
        which set of auto metrics to run (default min) 
    [-categories <string>]:
        metric categories to compute (all flow design setup power check hold route) 
    [-exclude_time_metric]:
