COMMAND: define_jtag_instruction
==================================================
  define_jtag_instruction: defines a JTAG instruction 

Usage: define_jtag_instruction -name <string> -opcode <string> [-register <string>] [-length <integer>] [-register_tdi <port|pin|hpin>] [-register_tdo <port|pin|hpin>]
           [-register_shiftdr <port|pin|hpin>] [-register_shiftdr_inverted] [-register_reset_inverted] [-register_capturedr <port|pin|hpin>] [-register_clockdr <port|pin|hpin>]
           [-register_updatedr <port|pin|hpin>] [-register_updatedr_state <port|pin|hpin>] [-register_capturedr_state <port|pin|hpin>] [-register_shiftdr_state <port|pin|hpin>]
           [-register_tck <port|pin|hpin>] [-register_reset <port|pin|hpin>] [-register_runidle <port|pin|hpin>] [-register_decode <port|pin|hpin>] [-capture <string>]
           [-tap_tdo <port|pin|hpin>] [-tap_decode <port|pin|hpin>] [-private] [-design <design>]

    -name <string>:
        name of JTAG instruction 
    -opcode <string>:
        opcode of JTAG instruction 
    [-register <string>]:
        name of custom test data register for the JTAG instruction 
    [-length <integer>]:
        length of custom test data register 
    [-register_tdi <port|pin|hpin>]:
        test data in pin of custom test data register 
    [-register_tdo <port|pin|hpin>]:
        test data out pin of custom test data register 
    [-register_shiftdr <port|pin|hpin>]:
        shiftdr pin of custom test data register 
    [-register_shiftdr_inverted]:
        shiftdr pin of custom test data register has an active low polarity 
    [-register_reset_inverted]:
        reset pin of custom test data register has an active low polarity 
    [-register_capturedr <port|pin|hpin>]:
        capturedr pin of custom test data register 
    [-register_clockdr <port|pin|hpin>]:
        clockdr pin of custom test data register 
    [-register_updatedr <port|pin|hpin>]:
        updatedr pin of custom test data register 
    [-register_updatedr_state <port|pin|hpin>]:
        updatedr_state pin of custom test data register 
    [-register_capturedr_state <port|pin|hpin>]:
        capturedr_state pin of custom test data register 
    [-register_shiftdr_state <port|pin|hpin>]:
        shiftdr_state pin of custom test data register 
    [-register_tck <port|pin|hpin>]:
        tck pin of custom test data register 
    [-register_reset <port|pin|hpin>]:
        reset pin of custom test data register 
    [-register_runidle <port|pin|hpin>]:
        runidle pin of custom test data register 
    [-register_decode <port|pin|hpin>]:
        instruction decode pin of custom test data register 
    [-capture <string>]:
        capture value of custom test data register 
    [-tap_tdo <port|pin|hpin>]:
        instruction specific JTAG_MACRO tdo input pin to be connected to the custom test data register tdo pin 
    [-tap_decode <port|pin|hpin>]:
        instruction specific JTAG_MACRO decode output pin to be connected to the custom test data register decode pin 
    [-private]:
        specifies that the JTAG instruction is private 
    [-design <design>]:
        top-block (required if there are multiple top designs) 

