  define_scan_preserved_segment: defines a scan segment whose elements have been previously connected 

Usage: define_scan_preserved_segment [-name <string>] [-sdi <pin|hpin|port|hport>] [-sdo <pin|hpin|port|hport>] [-hookup_pin_sdi <pin|hpin|port|hport>]
           [-hookup_pin_sdo <pin|hpin|port|hport>] [-analyze] [-connected_shift_enable] [-allow_reordering] [<scan_segment|inst|hinst|port|hpin|pin>+]

    [-name <string>]:
