    [-wir_tm_value {high|low}]:
        specifies the value of the WIR output pin when the WIR is being scan tested (high|low) 
    [-pipeline_depth <integer>]:
        specifies the number of pipeline stages to be inserted for this test signal 
    [-shared_output]:
        whether the test signal data output pin/port is shared with a functional connection 
    [-lec_value {0|1|no_value|auto}]:
