COMMAND: is_attribute
==================================================
  is_attribute: check if an attribute exists 

Usage: is_attribute <string> -obj_type <string>

    <string>:
        attribute name 
    -obj_type <string>:
        object type 

    Valid object types are:

        actual_scan_chain                  fpobject                             level_shifter_group                  opcg_trigger                         route_rule 
        actual_scan_segment                fuse_cell                            level_shifter_rule                   opcond                               route_type 
        analysis_view                      fuse_cell_domain                     lib_arc                              operating_condition                  row 
        arc                                gcell                                lib_cell                             osc_source                           scan_chain 
        attribute                          gcell_grid                           lib_pin                              osc_source_reference                 scan_segment 
        base_cell                          group                                library                              pcell                                sdp_column 
        base_cell_set                      hdl_architecture                     library_domain                       pdomain                              sdp_group 
        base_pin                           hdl_bind                             library_set                          pg_base_pin                          sdp_instance 
        blackbox                           hdl_block                            macro_isolation_rule                 pg_hnet                              sdp_row 
        blockage                           hdl_component                        macro_model                          pg_hport                             seq_function 
        boundary_scan_segment              hdl_configuration                    macro_power_domain                   pg_lib_pin                           site 
        bump                               hdl_implementation                   mbist_clock                          pg_net                               slot 
        cell                               hdl_inst                             mbist_clock_domain                   pg_pin                               specialnet 
        cell_model                         hdl_label                            memory_bank_structure                pg_port                              state_retention_rule 
        clock                              hdl_lib                              memory_data_bit_structure            pin                                  style 
        cluster                            hdl_operator                         memory_lib_cell                      pin_bus                              tap_port 
