Usage: read_db [<string>] [-from_tcl <string>] [-quiet] [-verbose] [-mmmc_file <string>] [-setup_views <string>+] [-hold_views <string>+] [-leakage_view <string>] [-dynamic_view <string>]

    [<string>]:
