==================================================
COMMAND: read_ilm_from_files
==================================================
  read_ilm_from_files: imports ILM model for a specific module 

Usage: read_ilm_from_files -input_directory <string> [-output_directory <string>] [-prefix <string>] -module_name <string> [-verilog_file <string>] [-place_file <string>]
           [-upf_invs_read_ilm] [-innovus] [-logical] [-def_file <string>] [-lef_file <string>] [-upf_file <string>] [-sdc_file <string>] [-sdc_by_mode <string>] [-spef_file <string>]
           [-spef_by_corner <string>] [-view_map <string>] [-corner_map <string>]

    -input_directory <string>:
        directory path for ILM data 
    [-output_directory <string>]:
        directory path to write out Genus created ILM data 
    [-prefix <string>]:
        prefix for ILM module files (by default module_name becomes the prefix) 
    -module_name <string>:
        name of the ILM module 
    [-verilog_file <string>]:
        name of Verilog file of ILM module 
    [-place_file <string>]:
        name of Innovus Place file of ILM module 
    [-upf_invs_read_ilm]:
        upf file coming from Innovus read_ilm 
    [-innovus]:
        load Innovus ILM or SHDB 
    [-logical]:
        load only logical ILM 
    [-def_file <string>]:
        name of DEF file of ILM module (optional ONLY for logical ILM flow) 
    [-lef_file <string>]:
        name of LEF file of ILM module (optional) 
    [-upf_file <string>]:
        name of UPF file of ILM module (optional) 
    [-sdc_file <string>]:
        name of SDC file of ILM module (provide atleast SPEF or SDC file for ILM module.) 
    [-sdc_by_mode <string>]:
        path of SDC files for multiple analysis views in the design. Provide a list of lists. Eg. {{view_a sdc_file_for_mode_a} {view_b sdc_file_for_mode_b} ...} (provide atleast SPEF or 
        SDC file for ILM module.) 
    [-spef_file <string>]:
        name of SPEF file of ILM module (provide atleast SPEF or SDC file for ILM module.) 
    [-spef_by_corner <string>]:
        path of SPEF files for multiple rc-corners of ILM module. Provide a list of lists. Eg. {{corner_a spef_file_for_corner_a} {corner_b spef_file_for_corner_b} ...} 
    [-view_map <string>]:
        SDC views for mapping. Specify a list of lists: {{view1 top_view1} {view2 top_view2} ...} 
    [-corner_map <string>]:
        SPEF corners for mapping. Specify a list of lists: {{corner1 top_corner1} {corner2 top_corner2} ...} 

