  report_dft_trace_back: trace back one level from a given pin 

Usage: report_dft_trace_back [-mode <integer>] [-polarity] [-continue] [-list] <pin|hpin|hport|port>

    [-mode <integer>]:
        trace back one level under the specified mode (0-3). 0: no constant propagation, 1: tied-constant propagation, 2: tied-constant and test-mode propagation, 3: tied-constant, 
        test-mode and shift-enable propagation [default: 3] 
