==================================================
  report_memory_cells: print memory cells in the library 

Usage: report_memory_cells [<library>] [> file]

    [<library>]:
        library for reporting of cells 

==================================================
COMMAND: report_metric
==================================================
  report_metric: report metric 

Usage: report_metric [-format {html|json|excel|text|vivid}] [-out_file <string>] [-id <string>] [-names <string>] [<string>]

    [-format {html|json|excel|text|vivid}]:
        output format 
    [-out_file <string>]:
        target file name filename 
    [-id <string>]:
        IDs of metrics to report (multiple IDs will produce a comparison, first is gold) 
    [-names <string>]:
        list of names (wildcards supported) 
    [<string>]:
        pattern to match 

