COMMAND: report_qor
==================================================
  report_qor: prints a QOR report 

Usage: report_qor [-levels_of_logic] [-exclude_constant_nets] [-no_power] [-ndr_min_layer] [-power] [-view <analysis_view>] [<design>] [> file]

    [-levels_of_logic]:
