COMMAND: report_sequential
==================================================
  report_sequential: prints a sequential instance report 

Usage: report_sequential [-hinst <inst|hinst>] [-hier] [-deleted] [-optimized] [-mapping] [-insts <inst>+] [<design|module>] [> file]

    [-hinst <inst|hinst>]:
        specifies hierarchical instance name to report sequential elements 
