==================================================
COMMAND: set_cglar_specification
==================================================
  set_cglar_specification: setup cglar data 

Usage: set_cglar_specification ( -root <design> | -detailed_help ) [-elab_db <string>] [-elab_tcl <string>] [-reg_list <string>] [-exclude_flops <string>] [-locations_list <string>]
           [-d_slack_list <string>] [-cg_en_slack_list <string>] [-apply_cglar_options <string>] [-compute_cglar_options <string>] [-report_cglar_options <string>]
           [-read_stimulus_options <string>] [-no_db_flow] [-allow_mismatch_factor <float>] [-original_name] [-reset]

    -root <design>:
        top design 
    [-detailed_help]:
        extract help on compute_cglar and report_cglar from joules 
    [-elab_db <string>]:
        specify path to elaborate database db file 
    [-elab_tcl <string>]:
        specify path to elaborate database tcl file 
    [-reg_list <string>]:
        specify list of flops 
    [-exclude_flops <string>]:
        specify list of flops to be excluded 
    [-locations_list <string>]:
        specify custom location information 
    [-d_slack_list <string>]:
        specify custom slack information at data pin 
    [-cg_en_slack_list <string>]:
        specify custom slack information at clock enable pin 
    [-apply_cglar_options <string>]:
        specify custom apply_cglar command options 
    [-compute_cglar_options <string>]:
        specify custom -compute_cglar option value of apply_cglar command 
    [-report_cglar_options <string>]:
        specify custom -report_cglar_options option value of apply_cglar command 
    [-read_stimulus_options <string>]:
        specify custom -read_stimulus_options option value of apply_cglar command 
    [-no_db_flow]:
        export netlist and not a db 
    [-allow_mismatch_factor <float>]:
        allow mismatch of flops from the list, range 0 to 1. Default is 0.2 
    [-original_name]:
        use only original_name data 
    [-reset]:
        reset data 

