Usage: update_rc_corner -name <rc_corner> [-temperature <float>] [-qrc_tech <string>] [-cap_table <string>] [-pre_route_res <float>] [-pre_route_cap <float>] [-post_route_res <float>+]
           [-post_route_cap <float>+] [-post_route_cross_cap <float>+] [-pre_route_clock_res <float>] [-pre_route_clock_cap <float>] [-post_route_clock_res <float>+]
           [-post_route_clock_cap <float>+]

    -name <rc_corner>:
        name of the rc_corner 
