COMMAND: update_scan_chains
==================================================
  update_scan_chains: updates specified flops into existing scan chains 

Usage: update_scan_chains [-flops <inst|hinst>+] [-chains <actual_scan_chain>+] [-type <string>] [-max_list_flops <integer>] [-preview] [<design>] [> file]

    [-flops <inst|hinst>+]:
        testpoint instances to be used 
    [-chains <actual_scan_chain>+]:
        name(s) of the actual scan chain(s) to be updated (default: all actual scan chains) 
    [-type <string>]:
        type of testpoint to be update in scan chains {Valid values are 'dfa','rrfa','user','compression_testpoints', Default is to insert all testpoint types} 
    [-max_list_flops <integer>]:
        max no. of test point flops to report (default:all) 
    [-preview]:
        reports what would be done, but does not update the scan chains 
    [<design>]:
        update scan chains for this top module 

