COMMAND: write_def
==================================================
  write_def: exports floorplan in DEF format 

Usage: write_def [-ignore_groups] [-ignore_placed_instances] [-scan_chains] [-version <string>] [-hierarchical <instance>] [-exclude_ilm] [-no_special_net] [-no_ilm_pg_net] [-no_def_pin]
           [-no_die_area] [<design>] [> file]

    [-ignore_groups]:
        do not write instance group information 
    [-ignore_placed_instances]:
        do not write instances with placement status other than fixed 
    [-scan_chains]:
        include scan chain information 
    [-version <string>]:
        version 
    [-hierarchical <instance>]:
        hierarchical instance to write out 
    [-exclude_ilm]:
        skip placement information of ILM modules 
    [-no_special_net]:
        exclude special net information 
    [-no_ilm_pg_net]:
        exclude power and ground special net for ILMs 
    [-no_def_pin]:
        exclude def_pin objects 
    [-no_die_area]:
        exclude DIEAREA, PROPERTYDEFINITIONS and UNITS statements 
    [<design>]:
        design 

