COMMAND: write_design
==================================================
  write_design: generates design snapshot 

Usage: write_design [-base_name <string>] [-gzip_files] [-innovus] [-handoff <string>] [-hierarchical] [-exclude_ilm] [<design>]

    [-base_name <string>]:
        path and base filename for output data 
    [-gzip_files]:
        compress netlist and constraints 
    [-innovus]:
