==================================================
  write_dft_lbist_test_points: writes out data and script files for Random Resistant Fault Analysis (RRFA) 

Usage: write_dft_lbist_test_points [-library <string>] [-directory <string>] [-run_from_directory] [-continue_with_severe] [-force] [-build_model_options <string>]
           [-build_testmode_options <string>] [-build_faultmodel_options <string>] [-lbist_testpoints_options <string>] [-verify_test_structures_options <string>]
           [-min_slack_for_no_tp_file <integer>] [-unix_shell] [-intest] [<design>]

