    [-min_slack_for_no_tp_file <integer>]:
        slack (in ps) for preventing insertion of a test point <-10000000> 
    [-unix_shell]:
        write output in shell format 
    [-intest]:
        test point analysis in fullscan intest testmode 
    [<design>]:
        top-level design for which to write out the Modus files 

