==================================================
  write_dft_rtl_model: writes an RTL model of the design in Verilog assuming DFT RTL insertion flow has been enabled and DFT insertion commands supporting the RTL update flow have been run 

Usage: write_dft_rtl_model -directory <string> [-overwrite] [<design>]

    -directory <string>:
