==================================================
COMMAND: report_power
==================================================
Reports the power of the design.

Usage: report_power [-stims <string>+] [-frames <string>+] [-inst <hinst>+] [-module <sub_module>+] [-clock_domain <clock_domain>+] [-power_domain <power_domain>+] [-collate <frames|hier|domain|all|none>] [-power_mode <power_mode>] [-power_rail <power_rail>+] [-by_category] [-by_hierarchy] [-by_leaf_instance] [-by_rail] [-by_func_type] [-by_libcell] [-by_tiles <string>] [-unit W|mW|uW|nW] [-format <format>] [-header] [-view <analysis_view>] [-skip_port_switching_power] [> file]

    [-stims <string>+]:
        Specify the stims. By default all stims.
    [-frames <string>+]:
        Specify the frames or frame range. By default frame#0 of all stims. 
    [-inst <hinst>+]:
        List of hierarchical insts for power report.
    [-module <sub_module>+]:
        List of sub_modules for power report.
        [-levels <string>]: 
            Number of levels to be reported. Default value is 0. If -levels is all, all levels will be reported.
    [-clock_domain <clock_domain>+]: 
        Reports the power of given clock domain. 
    [-power_domain <power_domain>+]: 
        Reports the power of given power domain. 
    [-collate <frames|hier|domain|all|none>]: 
        Collate the power by frames, hier, domain, all, none.
    [-power_mode <power_mode>]: 
        Reports the power of given power mode. 
    [-power_rail <power_rail>+]: 
        Reports the power of given power rail. 
    [-assign_to_clock <memory|register|latch|pad>+]:
        Allocate power of memory/flop/latch clock pin and pad in clock path to clock network.
    [-by_category]: 
        Report the power by category. 
        Type report_power -by_category -help for sub-options.
    [-by_hierarchy]: 
        Report the power by hierarchy. 
        Type report_power -by_hierarchy -help for sub-options.
    [-by_leaf_instance]: 
        Report the power by leaf instance. 
        Type report_power -by_leaf_instance -help for sub-options.
    [-by_rail]: 
        Report the power by rail. 
    [-by_func_type]: 
        Report the power by function type. 
        Type report_power -by_func_type -help for sub-options.
    [-by_libcell]: 
        Report the power by libcell. 
        Type report_power -by_libcell -help for sub-options.
    [-by_tiles <string>]: 
        Report the power by tiles <rows>X<cols>. 
        [-style <simple|transient>]:
            Default: transient.
        [-cols <leakage|internal|switching|total>+]:
            Default: total.
    [-unit W|mW|uW|nW]: 
        Default value is value of attribute power_unit.
    [-format <format>]: 
        Default value is value of attribute power_format.
    [-header]: 
        Generates report header. 
    [-view <analysis_view>]: 
        Reports the power for a given analysis view.
    [-skip_port_switching_power]: 
        Skips the port switching power. 

