  check_power_structure: verifies whether the low power cells in the design conform to the CPF file 

Usage: check_power_structure [-debug] [-run_dir <string>] [-detail] [-isolation] [-level_shifter] [-retention] [-all] [-pre_synthesis] [-pre_synth] [-post_synthesis] [-post_synth]
